So shall we plan what we have to do for this assignment?

63
00:02:39,290 --> 00:02:39,880
LUKE:

64
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:40,470
OK.

65
00:02:40,470 --> 00:02:40,793
SUSIE:

66
00:02:40,793 --> 00:02:43,700
First, we have to decide on our research question.

67
00:02:43,700 --> 00:02:50,234
So how about ‘Is there a relationship between hours of sleep

68
00:02:50,234 --> 00:02:52,610
