82
00:03:15,050 --> 00:03:15,330
LUKE:

83
00:03:15,330 --> 00:03:16,730
I don't really know any.

84
00:03:16,730 --> 00:03:17,162
SUSIE:

85
00:03:17,162 --> 00:03:18,892
OK, forget that idea.

86
00:03:18,892 --> 00:03:22,350
