89
00:03:27,660 --> 00:03:28,058
LUKE:

90
00:03:28,058 --> 00:03:28,456
No.

91
00:03:28,456 --> 00:03:31,240
It needs to be self-reporting I think.

92
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:34,820
And we could ask them to answer questions online.

93
00:03:34,820 --> 00:03:35,236
SUSIE:

94
00:03:35,236 --> 00:03:41,054
But in this case, paper might be better as they'll be doing it straight

95
00:03:41,054 --> 00:03:45,210
